  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Equine assisted activities for vulnerable children</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">COVID-19, global insecurities, fear of climate change and forms of abuse at home or school are affecting children&apos;s emotional, physical and psychological development, increasing their fear and isolation. Romi&apos;s Way wants to support them by connecting children back to Nature and living creatures that are guiding children and youth to feel compassion, care, stillness and peace. Equine assisted interventions can heal, ease trauma and increase creativity and joy in children with quality outdoor time</narrative>
  </description>
